            "review_title": "Review at Kho An Trang",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary20545 contributions\n1\nVery simple dinner\nMay 2022 • Business\nLooking for someone special from local cuisine. Ended with bun cha, spring rolls and tiger beer. Empty place, tasty food, quickly served, really enjoyed time. You can order soup bun cha pork, fish one. Open space on the street, we were alone for early dinner. Place is just few hundred meters from big street and it’s value for money 💰\nWritten May 20, 2022",
